        "VAULT_TALK_CONFIRM_2": "Once the key turns, there's no turnin' back. Ready?",
        "VAULT_TALK_CONFIRM_3": "A bold choice! Say the word and we'll crack her open.",
        "VAULT_TALK_EMPTY_1": "Nothin' left in that one but coin and bad luck. Still want a go?",
        "VAULT_TALK_EMPTY_2": "I'll be straight with ye: that chest's been picked near clean. Still turnin' the key?",
